    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As part of AKDN's commitment to net zero by 2030, the Aga Khan University (AKU) is installing its largest solar photovoltaic (PV) project to date. To commence the project, a signing ceremony was held with Exide Pakistan Limited, who will be executing the project at AKU's Stadium Road Campus in Karachi, Pakistan.",
